    "id": 585050,
    "title": "Yarmouk University IEEE Day Celebration 2026",
    "description": "<p>Celebrate <strong>IEEE Day</strong> at Yarmouk University! Join us for an inspiring day filled with technology, innovation, and community engagement. Explore cutting-edge student projects, attend interactive technical workshops, network with fellow engineers, and learn more about how IEEE empowers future innovators and tech leaders.</p>",
