    "id": 585009,
    "title": " IEEE YU Day Celebration 2026",
    "description": "<p><strong>The IEEE Student Branch at Yarmouk University (YU) is proudly preparing to host an extraordinary IEEE Day celebration, with the organizing team working tirelessly behind the scenes to design a comprehensive and memorable experience for the student community. The event program features a diverse array of engaging interactive activities, insightful sessions, and creative segments that embody the core spirit of IEEE&mdash;leveraging technology for the benefit of humanity. Additionally, the IEEE Computer Society (CS) Chapter is actively preparing a distinct set of fresh and innovative activities tailored to enhance technical skill sets, spark curiosity, and provide valuable hands-on learning experiences and practical challenges. This event highlights the hard work, collaborative energy, and vibrant engineering culture of the IEEE community at Yarmouk University.</strong></p>",
